Description: obs-nvenc: send the frame packing arrangement SEI
 An NV_ENC_SEI_PAYLOAD (payloadType 45) built from the canvas's layout bit by bit after H.264 D.1.26 and H.265
 D.2.16, sent with every picture of H.264 and HEVC: both eye orders, quincunx, frames in turn with
 current_frame_is_frame0_flag alternating; HEVC only for types 3 to 5 (Table D.8), any other told in the log.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (ORDER 61, milestone 2)
Forwarded: no, OBS asks for human-written submissions only (CONTRIBUTING.md, AI/Machine Learning Policy)
Last-Update: 2026-11-21
